--- !yfi/header
version: 1
namespace: vis::shut
visibility: private
# A private scope may relate a node it can see. An observer outside it sees
# `Alpha` and may not see what this scope says about it, so the relation is
# absent from `incident_edges_visible_from` while `Alpha` itself is not.
--- !edge &Private
pub connections: [../open/Alpha]
